            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu maanami afuntili cheŋi, nimpuhu yawanta wami, ni kulema kwami, nikuzúuma kwami kwafuntili cheŋi; niantu ami awakulumpi amuchota, niayilolu jami enjili nakunkeŋakeŋa. Wanta wami wakoleli cheŋi, hiyakunshilaku ni kulema kwakubadika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu ami Nebukaneza hinukuhameka nakutúumbakesha nakulemesha Mwanta wamwiwulu; muloŋa nyidimu yindi yejima yalala hohu yákubula kutwamba, mwejima mwelaŋayi mwaloŋa hohu. Antu endaŋa nakudinka wanta, yena natweshi kuyikehesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
